# transjakarta-analytics/api, db, and ingestion are Render/Neon tooling
# (see transjakarta-analytics/README.md), never needed by either Vercel
# project. transjakarta-analytics/web is deliberately NOT excluded here:
# it deploys as its own separate Vercel project (Root Directory =
# transjakarta-analytics/web), and Vercel applies this file repo-wide
# regardless of which project is building, so excluding the whole
# transjakarta-analytics/ tree (the previous version of this file) would
# make that project's build empty, same failure mode as the earlier
# Root Directory bug. This Astro project accepts a little extra "Using
# TypeScript" build-log noise from web/'s own tsconfig.json as the
# tradeoff.
transjakarta-analytics/api/
transjakarta-analytics/db/
transjakarta-analytics/ingestion/
transjakarta-analytics/render.yaml
